## Testing Policy

<% if (governanceLevel === 'L1') { %>### L1 (Minimal)

- Unit tests for all business logic
- No mocking of internal modules (only external boundaries)
- Coverage target: 70%<% } %><% if (governanceLevel === 'L2') { %>### L2 (Standard)

- Unit tests: 80% coverage minimum
- Integration tests for all external boundaries (database, APIs)
- No mocking of internal modules — only boundary mocks
- TDD preferred: test first, then implement<% } %><% if (governanceLevel === 'L3') { %>### L3 (Full Audit)

- Unit tests: 85% coverage minimum
- Integration tests: all external boundaries covered
- E2E tests: critical user journeys covered
- Evidence artifacts generated and retained for all test runs
- TDD required: test first is non-negotiable<% } %>

